      "claim_id": "PIT-004-C3",
      "kind": "recommendation",
      "statement": "Compute target encodings out-of-fold on training data only, and never target-encode identifiers; an identifier that looks predictive is memorizing labels. Even encoding training rows with their own label (without out-of-fold) teaches the model to trust a column that is useless on new rows.",
      "evidence": [
